{"title":"你好，我是张俊豪 👋","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"","page-layout":"full","toc":false},"headingText":"你好，我是张俊豪 👋","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n::: {.hero-section}\n::: {.hero-content}\n\n::: {.hero-avatar}\n![](images/avatar.png){.avatar-img}\n:::\n\n::: {.hero-text}\n\n**数据科学爱好者 · 统计学研究生 · Quarto 学习者**\n\n就读于中山大学统计学院，热衷于用数据讲述故事，探索统计建模与机器学习的奥秘。\n目前正在学习 Quarto，希望通过这个网站记录我的学习历程与成果。\n\n::: {.hero-buttons}\n[了解我 →](about.qmd){.btn .btn-primary}\n[查看项目 →](projects.qmd){.btn .btn-outline}\n[阅读博客 →](blog/index.qmd){.btn .btn-outline}\n:::\n\n:::\n:::\n:::\n\n---\n\n## 🌟 技能速览\n\n::: {.skills-grid}\n\n::: {.skill-card}\n### 📊 数据分析\nR · Python · SQL · Excel  \n从数据清洗到可视化，全流程处理\n:::\n\n::: {.skill-card}\n### 🤖 统计建模\n线性回归 · 贝叶斯推断  \n广义线性模型 · 时间序列\n:::\n\n::: {.skill-card}\n### 🎨 数据可视化\nggplot2 · matplotlib · Plotly  \n让数据开口说话\n:::\n\n::: {.skill-card}\n### 📝 文档写作\nQuarto · R Markdown · LaTeX  \n可重复性研究与技术写作\n:::\n\n:::\n\n---\n\n## 🔥 最新动态\n\n::: {.timeline}\n\n::: {.timeline-item}\n**2026.03** — 🎉 个人网站上线！开始记录 Quarto 学习之旅\n:::\n\n::: {.timeline-item}\n**2026.02** — 📚 完成《贝叶斯统计》课程，开始实战项目\n:::\n\n::: {.timeline-item}\n**2025.12** — 🏆 参加全国大学生统计建模大赛，获三等奖\n:::\n\n::: {.timeline-item}\n**2025.09** — 🎓 正式入学中山大学统计学院研究生\n:::\n\n:::\n\n---\n\n## 📬 联系我\n\n::: {.contact-row}\n\n::: {.contact-item}\n📧 [junhao@example.com](mailto:junhao@example.com)\n:::\n\n::: {.contact-item}\n🐙 [GitHub @junhaozhang](https://github.com/junhaozhang)\n:::\n\n::: {.contact-item}\n📍 广州，广东\n:::\n\n:::\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n::: {.hero-section}\n::: {.hero-content}\n\n::: {.hero-avatar}\n![](images/avatar.png){.avatar-img}\n:::\n\n::: {.hero-text}\n# 你好，我是张俊豪 👋\n\n**数据科学爱好者 · 统计学研究生 · Quarto 学习者**\n\n就读于中山大学统计学院，热衷于用数据讲述故事，探索统计建模与机器学习的奥秘。\n目前正在学习 Quarto，希望通过这个网站记录我的学习历程与成果。\n\n::: {.hero-buttons}\n[了解我 →](about.qmd){.btn .btn-primary}\n[查看项目 →](projects.qmd){.btn .btn-outline}\n[阅读博客 →](blog/index.qmd){.btn .btn-outline}\n:::\n\n:::\n:::\n:::\n\n---\n\n## 🌟 技能速览\n\n::: {.skills-grid}\n\n::: {.skill-card}\n### 📊 数据分析\nR · Python · SQL · Excel  \n从数据清洗到可视化，全流程处理\n:::\n\n::: {.skill-card}\n### 🤖 统计建模\n线性回归 · 贝叶斯推断  \n广义线性模型 · 时间序列\n:::\n\n::: {.skill-card}\n### 🎨 数据可视化\nggplot2 · matplotlib · Plotly  \n让数据开口说话\n:::\n\n::: {.skill-card}\n### 📝 文档写作\nQuarto · R Markdown · LaTeX  \n可重复性研究与技术写作\n:::\n\n:::\n\n---\n\n## 🔥 最新动态\n\n::: {.timeline}\n\n::: {.timeline-item}\n**2026.03** — 🎉 个人网站上线！开始记录 Quarto 学习之旅\n:::\n\n::: {.timeline-item}\n**2026.02** — 📚 完成《贝叶斯统计》课程，开始实战项目\n:::\n\n::: {.timeline-item}\n**2025.12** — 🏆 参加全国大学生统计建模大赛，获三等奖\n:::\n\n::: {.timeline-item}\n**2025.09** — 🎓 正式入学中山大学统计学院研究生\n:::\n\n:::\n\n---\n\n## 📬 联系我\n\n::: {.contact-row}\n\n::: {.contact-item}\n📧 [junhao@example.com](mailto:junhao@example.com)\n:::\n\n::: {.contact-item}\n🐙 [GitHub @junhaozhang](https://github.com/junhaozhang)\n:::\n\n::: {.contact-item}\n📍 广州，广东\n:::\n\n:::\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":false,"echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":nu